    <bpmn:process id="W_W4043" name="W4043. Political &amp; Regulatory Risk Monitoring, Scenario &amp; Exposure Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monitoring cycle; scenario need; risk register update
Frequency: Continuous + quarterly
Volume: Enterprise
Owner: Government Affairs Manager / VP Legal
Participants: Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Legal, Insights (links to VS-44), Strategy (links to VS-33), Compliance, Internal Audit/Risk (links to VS-21.2)
Source: workflow W4043 — Political &amp; Regulatory Risk Monitoring, Scenario &amp; Exposure Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4043_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4043_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4043_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4043_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4043_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4043_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4043_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4043_Start3" name="Monitoring cycle; scenario need; risk register update">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4043_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4043_Task4" name="Govt Affairs/Insights monitor political and regulatory developments (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs/Insights monitor political and regulatory developments (links to W4040) and assess exposure and scenarios (election outcomes, policy shifts, enforcement priorities, geopolitical/trade impacts on supply chain links to VS-02/VS-87)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Insights / Strategy
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4043_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4043_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4043_Task5" name="Govt Affairs/Legal run scenario and exposure analysis (likelihood/impact), feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs/Legal run scenario and exposure analysis (likelihood/impact), feed material risks into the ERM risk register (links to VS-21.2) and strategy (links to VS-33), and develop mitigation/contingency options
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal / Risk
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4043_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4043_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4043_Task6" name="Govt Affairs brief leadership and the Board (links to VS-36) on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs brief leadership and the Board (links to VS-36) on political/regulatory risk and scenarios, and refresh on change
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4043_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4043_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4043_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4043_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4043_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-628 (ensure controlled execution — Stakeholder &amp; Government Affairs Governance, Monitoring &amp; Analytics (PA-132.3).) | - operational: scenarios and contingency options; operational: integration with VS-21
Owner: Government Affairs Manager / VP Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W4043_Assoc9" sourceRef="W4043_Annotation8" targetRef="W4043_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
