    <bpmn:process id="W_W4044" name="W4044. Coalition, Partnership &amp; Multi-Stakeholder Initiative Governance" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Coalition/initiative opportunity or BuildRight participation
Frequency: On opportunity + maintained
Volume: Occasional
Owner: Government Affairs Manager / VP Legal
Participants: Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Legal, Compliance (links to VS-119), Sustainability (links to VS-25), affected business units, Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W4044 — Coalition, Partnership &amp; Multi-Stakeholder Initiative Governance</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4044_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4044_Lane1" name="Govt Affairs">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4044_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4044_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4044_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4044_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4044_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4044_Start3" name="Coalition/initiative opportunity or BuildRight participation">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4044_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4044_Task4" name="Govt Affairs/Legal assess coalition/multi-stakeholder initiative opportunities…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Govt Affairs/Legal assess coalition/multi-stakeholder initiative opportunities (industry coalitions, public-private partnerships, multi-stakeholder initiatives) for strategic fit, competition risk (links to VS-129 W3963/W3965), ABC exposure (links to VS-86), and reputational alignment
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal / Strategy
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Per opportunity</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4044_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4044_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4044_Task5" name="Govt Affairs/Legal establish governance for BuildRight participation: scope…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Govt Affairs/Legal establish governance for BuildRight participation: scope, BuildRight&#x27;s role and positions, information-barrier/competition protocols (links to VS-129), and exit rights; integrate with association-membership review (W4029)
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs / Legal
Accountable (A): VP Legal
Duration: Per participation</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4044_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4044_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4044_Task6" name="Govt Affairs manage participation in-life, document positions/submissions…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Govt Affairs manage participation in-life, document positions/submissions (links to W4028/W4032), and review continued participation periodically
Responsible (R): Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): Government Affairs Manager
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4044_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4044_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
