    <bpmn:process id="W_W4045" name="W4045. Crisis Political &amp; Reputational Issue Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Political/election-law allegation; reputational crisis; investigation/media
Frequency: On event + maintained readiness
Volume: Occasional
Owner: VP Legal / CEO
Participants: Legal (links to VS-100), Corporate Communications (links to VS-14.3), Compliance (links to VS-119), Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), ABC (links to VS-86), affected business unit, CEO, Board, external counsel/PR
Source: workflow W4045 — Crisis Political &amp; Reputational Issue Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4045_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4045_Lane1" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4045_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4045_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4045_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4045_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4045_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4045_Start3" name="Political/election-law allegation; reputational crisis; investigation/media">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4045_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4045_Task4" name="Legal/Comms activate crisis management on a political/reputational issue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Legal/Comms activate crisis management on a political/reputational issue (allegation of prohibited contribution, anti-graft breach, partisan-activity allegation, official investigation): convene the crisis team, assess facts and exposure, and stabilize
Responsible (R): Legal / Comms / CEO
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: On event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4045_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4045_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4045_Task5" name="Legal/Comms manage the response: investigation (links to VS-119/VS-21)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Comms manage the response: investigation (links to VS-119/VS-21), legal/regulatory engagement (COMELEC/Ombudsman/BIR as relevant), communications (links to VS-14.3 crisis-comms), and stakeholder/investor/lender management
Responsible (R): Legal / Comms / Compliance
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: On event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4045_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4045_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4045_Task6" name="Legal/Compliance manage resolution, remediation (links to VS-119 W3724…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Legal/Compliance manage resolution, remediation (links to VS-119 W3724 remediation), lessons learned, and disclosure (links to W4032), and report to the Board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Legal / Compliance / Comms
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Post-event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4045_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4045_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4045_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4045_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
