      <bpmn:userTask id="W4046_Task5" name="Internal Audit/Legal run periodic political-engagement compliance audits…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Internal Audit/Legal run periodic political-engagement compliance audits: contribution/donation controls (W4027/W4034), lobbying/advocacy governance (W4028), election-period compliance (W4033), anti-graft controls (W4037), revolving-door (W4038), and records/disclosure (W4032)
Responsible (R): Internal Audit / Legal / Compliance
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
