    <bpmn:process id="W_W4048" name="W4048. Political-Engagement Program Review, Continuous Improvement &amp; Board Oversight" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual review; election-cycle close; regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + per cycle
Volume: Enterprise program
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CEO
Participants: VP Legal, Compliance (links to VS-119), Govt Affairs (links to VS-104), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), Strategy (links to VS-33), CEO, Board Audit/Risk Committee
Source: workflow W4048 — Political-Engagement Program Review, Continuous Improvement &amp; Board Oversight</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4048_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4048_Lane1" name="VP Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4048_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4048_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4048_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4048_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4048_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4048_Start3" name="Annual review; election-cycle close; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4048_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4048_Task4" name="VP Legal run the annual program review (policy currency W4025, control…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: VP Legal run the annual program review (policy currency W4025, control effectiveness W4046, analytics W4047, incident lessons W4045), benchmark against peer/good-practice, and identify improvements
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Compliance / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4048_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4048_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4048_Task5" name="VP Legal monitor regulatory developments (election law, anti-graft…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: VP Legal monitor regulatory developments (election law, anti-graft, lobbying/transparency expectations) and adjust the program (links to W4040); secure budget/resources
Responsible (R): VP Legal / Govt Affairs
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Annual + on change</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4048_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4048_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4048_Task6" name="VP Legal/CEO report to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to VS-36/VS-21.2)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: VP Legal/CEO report to the Board Audit/Risk Committee (links to VS-36/VS-21.2): program status, material risks/engagements, compliance posture, incidents, and the forward plan; seek direction on risk appetite
Responsible (R): VP Legal / CEO
Accountable (A): Board Audit Committee
Duration: Quarterly + annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4048_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4048_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4048_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4048_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
