        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-628 (ensure controlled execution — Stakeholder &amp; Government Affairs Governance, Monitoring &amp; Analytics (PA-132.3).) | - operational: structured reporting; operational: benchmarking and review
Owner: VP Legal &amp; Compliance / CEO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
